NOTES
This is an early version, and several features have so far mostly been tested
on Linux. Please report problems, with the log file (Settings > Write log
file) if possible.

Source code: https://github.com/jaokim/Formbrod
ffmpeg libraries ported to AmigaOS 4 by Michael Trebilcock.
